culuscdn.com&oh=00_AftwL9IypmJbLwOZsXd-H8umwhou3I1qzqsykjRaRMzmJw&oe=69A5786F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Step-In-Store", "keywords": ["holomoves", "HoloMoves", "stepinstore", "steppingstore", "store"], "long_description": "Step-In Store is an innovative Mixed Reality game by HoloMoves that allows players to practice everyday activities in a playful and engaging way, with grocery shopping as the central theme. The game consists of three mini-games that together simulate the complete shopping experience.\n\nIn the first mini-game, players receive a shopping list and explore the virtual store to find products and place them in their basket. This encourages active exploration, focus, and goal-oriented movement.\n\nThe second mini-game revolves around self-scanning and paying for groceries, adding elements of coordination, and decision-making.\n\nIn the free-play level, players can choose their own pace and actions, offering additional freedom and engagement.\n\nThe game is inspired by real-life situations, making it recognizable and motivating.\n\n**(!) Step-In-Store is part of the larger HoloMoves package, a subscription service offering a wide variety of exergames specifically designed for rehabilitation and physical therapy. Get a personal license and learn more at www.holomoves.nl/en**", "short_description": "Step-In Store is an interactive Mixed Reality exergame where players practice everyday grocery shopping. Through three mini-games, allowing them to practice executive functions such as orientation, product selection, self-scanning, and payment. By actively looking around and moving, players fill their shopping basket and complete the shopping process at their own pace."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://holomoves.nl/en/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HoloMoves B.V.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holomoves.nl/en/",